Included Files:

List.c:       Source code for the List ADT.
Lex.c:        Source code for the Lex program. Contains Main.
testList.c:   Source code for the test program for the List ADT.

List.h:       Include .h file for the necessary List ADT functions.
makefile:     Makefile for included executables. Usage instructions inside.
README:       Usage and instructions for the program.

USAGE:

Run "make" to create Lex executable.
Run by using the command:
	Lex <infile> <outfile>
The Lex program lexographically orders the lines in the infile,
and then writes them to the outfile. 

Other make commands:
	make clean: removes generated files
	make testList: makes the testList executable
		run with: testList
	make check: runs valgrind on Lex, testing for memory leaks.
